OL,3,APolls set to close in Brazil's
OL,4,Apresidential election run-off between
OL,5,ALula and Bolsonaro's son
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolls are due to close shortly in
OL,8,FBrazil's closely fought presidential
OL,9,Felection run-off - here's what you need
OL,10,Fto know
OL,12,FVoting is due to end at 17:00 local
OL,13,Ftime (20:00 GMT) - but President Luiz
OL,14,FInacio Lula da Silva has asked for
OL,15,Fpolls to remain open longer after
OL,16,Freports of disruption to public
OL,17,Ftransport in some cities
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
