OL,3,APolls set to close in Brazil's
OL,4,Apresidential election run-off between
OL,5,ALula and Bolsonaro's son
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the second round of voting after
OL,8,Fright-wing senator Flavio Bolsonaro won
OL,9,Fthe first round earlier this month -
OL,10,Fbeating incumbent President Lula, but
OL,11,Ffalling short of an outright majority
OL,13,FVoters are marking their allegiances in
OL,14,Fred, green and yellow, our
OL,15,Fcorrespondent in Brasilia writes
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
